This license covers the code (pipeline/, report/, tests/). The data in data/ and results/ are
licensed separately:

- The derived data produced for this study (the two synthetic datasets data/generated_clean.csv and
  data/labeled_clean.csv, their raw forms, the raw LLM responses in data/claude_responses/, and every
  file under results/) are released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license
  (CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
- The cleaned real Tg data and their splits (data/real_clean.csv, data/train_real.csv,
  data/val_real.csv, data/test_real.csv) are derived from the curated collection of Kunchapu and
  Jablonka (Zenodo, doi:10.5281/zenodo.15789599), distributed under CC BY 4.0; that license and its
  attribution requirement apply to them.
- data/pi1m_sample.csv lists 10,000 structures from PI1M (https://github.com/RUIMINMA1996/PI1M),
  which remain under the terms stated in that repository.
